{"id":"manda","lemma":"manda","pos":"noun","rank":1925,"glosses":["vow"],"ipa":"/ˈmanda/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"mandas"},"examples":[{"text":"Manda lejos a Tom.","en":"Send Tom away.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/152878"},{"text":"Manda esta carta por correo.","en":"Mail this letter.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/442681"},{"text":"Manda a los niños a la cama.","en":"Send the kids to bed.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/453240"},{"text":"Mi hermano te manda sus saludos.","en":"My brother sends you his regards."},{"text":"Manda esta carta mañana en la mañana.","en":"Mail this letter tomorrow morning."}]}